  "name": "LanguagePackDeployer",
  "description": "LanguagePackDeployer is a web-based Intune deployment tool that streamlines multilingual rollouts for Windows and macOS. From a browser, you select languages, region, timezone, and keyboard overrides, then publish assigned policies or download ready-to-run deployment bundles. It includes 100 locale presets, the option to designate a primary UI language, and supports packaging as a Win32 app, Platform Script, or macOS Intune shell script with granular assignment controls.",
